@host = http://localhost:8084

### Get all notifications
GET {{host}}/api/notifications

### Get a single notification
GET {{host}}/api/notifications/1

### Get notifications for a specific user
GET {{host}}/api/notifications/user/USR-001

### Create a new notification
POST {{host}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userID": "USR-003",
  "message": "Compliance review pending for policy POL-2026-0050.",
  "category": "Compliance"
}

### Mark as read
PUT {{host}}/api/notifications/1/read

### Dismiss a notification
PUT {{host}}/api/notifications/3/dismiss

### Delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/notifications/2
